'''''Leontodon rigens''''', the '''rigid hawkbit''', is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Asteraceae]], native to [[São Miguel Island]] in the [[Azores]].<ref name="POWO_229472-1" >{{cite POWO |id=229472-1 |title=''Leontodon rigens'' (Aiton) Paiva & Ormonde |access-date=9 July 2023 }}</ref> A perennial reaching {{cvt|40|cm}}, it is readily available from commercial suppliers.<ref name="RHS_114474" >{{cite web |title=''Leontodon rigens'' rigid hawkbit |url=https://www.rhs.org.uk/plants/114474/leontodon-rigens/details |date=2023 |publisher=The Royal Horticultural Society |access-date=9 July 2023 |quote=Synonyms; ''Leontodon rigens'' 'Girandole', ''Microseris ringens'' hort. ... 9 suppliers }}</ref>
